The bot's only entry point was /start, so users had to find Matches,
Profile and Leaderboards inside the app. Registering the three commands
(with an FA-scoped list, since the app is EN/FA) puts them in Telegram's
own menu, and each handler answers with a web_app button that opens the
HashRouter deep link directly on that page.

